{"name":"Turning Tables","hex":"#b9aaa1","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"turning tables","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of turn tables"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/turning_tables"}],"entries":[{"title":"Turning Tables","blocks":[{"text":"\"Turning Tables\" is a song recorded by English singer-songwriter Adele for her second studio album, 21 (2011). Conceived after an altercation with her former lover, the song was co-written by Adele and singer-songwriter Ryan Tedder, whilst the production was completed by Jim Abbiss. \"Turning Tables\" is a pop ballad with a soulful sound; its instrumentation consists of piano, \"Broadway-worthy\" strings, and guitar. Lyrically, the song describes a domestic dispute in which its narrator assumes a defensive stance against a manipulative ex-lover. XL Recordings sent the song to UK mainstream radio on 5 November 2011 as the fifth single from 21."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/97/Turning_Tables_cover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turning_Tables"},{"title":"Turning","blocks":[{"text":"Turning is a machining process in which a cutting tool is held nearly stationary to cut a rotating workpiece. The cutting tool can be slowly moved back-and-forth and in-and-out to cut cylindrical shapes and flat surfaces on the workpiece. Turning is usually done with a lathe."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/SchruppenDrehen.jpg/330px-SchruppenDrehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turning"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg/500px-Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg/1280px-Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg/500px-Ryan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ryan Tedder co-wrote \"Turning Tables\" alongside Adele.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARyan_Tedder_OneRepublic_Austria_3.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Gwyneth_Paltrow_avp_Iron_Man_3_Paris.jpg/500px-Gwyneth_Paltrow_avp_Iron_Man_3_Paris.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Gwyneth_Paltrow_avp_Iron_Man_3_Paris.jpg/500px-Gwyneth_Paltrow_avp_Iron_Man_3_Paris.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"In 2011, Gwyneth Paltrow performed a cover of \"Turning Tables\" in the Glee episode \"A Night of Neglect\".","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGwyneth_Paltrow_avp_Iron_Man_3_Paris.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/StechenDrehen.jpg/500px-StechenDrehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/StechenDrehen.jpg/500px-StechenDrehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Parting aluminium","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStechenDrehen.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/SchlichtenDrehen.jpg/500px-SchlichtenDrehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/SchlichtenDrehen.jpg/500px-SchlichtenDrehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&